OL,3,GNEWSAMan guilty in Matthew Weller
OL,4,Amurder trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been found guilty of
OL,7,Fmurdering 44-year-old Matthew Weller
OL,8,Fafter driving into him with a car.
OL,10,FMuhammad Haarith, 23, of Exchange
OL,11,FStreet, Accrington, was convicted of
OL,12,Fmurder by a majority verdict at Preston
OL,13,FCrown Court.
OL,15,FHaarith had admitted manslaughter, but
OL,16,Fprosecutors said he deliberately drove
OL,17,Fat Weller after becoming angry during
OL,18,Fan encounter in Blackburn Road on 22
OL,19,FApril.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
