OL,5,
OL,6,FThe court heard he fled the scene,
OL,7,Fleaving Weller severely injured, before
OL,8,Ftaking "calculated" steps to cover his
OL,9,Ftracks, including destroying his phone
OL,10,Fand hiding his VW Passat.
